# body

Intended path docs/x.md -> md mode. FORM-PINNING regression control (MANDATORY):
the reviewer used the UNSUPPORTED block dash-list form instead of the pinned
inline-array. parse_allow_pairs only matches the single-line inline-array regex,
so the block form yields ZERO allow pairs -> the underlying `publisher: CalGEM`
field still BLOCKs (fail-toward-enforcement: a malformed allow-marker never
silently widens). Proves a future reviewer who picks the wrong form is fail-safe.
